"poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"እ ባ ሻራ ምጭድ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ኩም አጌና ካሜስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ፖኦ ማፐ ሻካናዉ፥","poem":1},{"text":"አባ ጋፃን ፆሳይ ዛዋ ዎስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"እ ሀንቀትያ ዎደ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ሳሎ ቱቀት ዳጋማን ኮኮሮሶና።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"ባ ዎልቃን አባ ስእ ኦስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ባ ጭንጫተን ራኣባ ጌተትያ ዶኣ ይሴስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"እ ባ ሸምፑዋን ሳሎታ ጌሼስ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እያ ኩሸይ ፆንገትያ ሾሻ ጫዴስ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"ሀይሳቲ ፆሳይ ኦያ ኦሶታፐ ጉታ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ኑ እያ ካልካሻ ፃላላ ስኦስ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"እያ ዎልቃ ደሹዋ አኬካናዉ ዳንዳኤይ ኦኔ?” ያግስ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/JOB/26.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/JOB/27.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/JOB/25.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}